  m_text: "<size=20>- 3 Scatters in the base reels triggers Free Games.\r\n- 10 Free
    Games is played with 2 sets of reels.\r\n- The 10 spin game counter is reset to
    1 when Free Games begins.\r\n- If 3 Scatters appears in either of the reel set,
    Free Games is re-triggered.\r\n"
